        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Solarize a Still\n\nInverts only the tones above a threshold, recreating the darkroom solarization effect. It runs locally on the image with no model or key.\n\n**How it works:** \"Image\" takes your picture. \"Solarize\" inverts every tone brighter than 110, and \"Result\" returns the solarized image.\n\n**Try this:** Lower the threshold on \"Solarize\" to 60 so more of the image inverts, or raise it to 200 to affect only the highlights."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
